@startuml system-overview-context
!include plantuml-theme.puml
left to right direction
title Context — Student News and the systems around it (UML component diagram)
actor "Demo user" as user
actor "API developer" as dev
component "Student News\n(web UI, REST API, database)" <<system>> as sys
rectangle "GitHub Actions\n(CI/CD service)" <<external>> as gha
rectangle "Docker Hub\n(image registry)" <<external>> as hub
user --> sys : creates, edits, publishes\nand deletes news (browser)
dev --> sys : reads OpenAPI docs and calls\nthe REST API (HTTP, JSON)
gha --> sys : builds, tests and packages\nevery pushed change
sys --> hub : pulls base images (Node, nginx,\nTemurin, Maven, PostgreSQL)
@enduml
